<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ArtiLatent</span>: Realistic Articulated 3D Object Generation via Structured Latents
</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_submissionid">1790</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_journal"><span class="ltx_note_name">Journal: </span>TOG</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>SIGGRAPH Asia 2025 Conference Papers; December 15–18, 2025; Hong Kong, Hong Kong</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">SIGGRAPH Asia 2025 Conference Papers (SA Conference Papers ’25), December 15–18, 2025, Hong Kong, Hong Kong</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3757377.3763922">10.1145/3757377.3763922</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-2137-3/2025/12</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Shape modeling</span></span></span>
